{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Millie's back and she's still mad! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this latest installment of the long-running Millie Megavolte series, you play as Millie Megavolte, Lance LeTourre, Kilzek Green, Anne Abelle and a ton of new characters too as they fight for what's right (&quot;right&quot; being a relative term here). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic! Instead of one big adventure, the story is told through lots of short ones. Every story involves different characters and gives a piece of the bigger picture of what's going on. At first, Millie and Lance set out to stop the Mole King but things get a little more complicated from there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Done with Story Mode? Great! Play Journey Mode FOREVER! Journey Mode is a rogue-lite-lite where the areas are randomized and the levels themselves are shuffled. Pick your team of four characters or go in solo and rampage across the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cool Bullet Points</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The humor is back! Those who don't like shock or blue humor may want to cover their eyes. There are girls in skimpy outfits running around too</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 14+ unique playable characters. Millie and her friends are back with a whole cast of even more friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play dress-up with multiple outfits and weapon choices for every character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Four difficulty levels from Noob to Master (plus two secret ones). Don't get pwned! Also, the baseline difficulty is way easier than the head-crushing-hard previous MTC games were </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No more tiny Flash-o-Vision! Millie 8 uses a custom engine (built with SFML) and runs in full 1080 and doesn't chug to reach 60 FPS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with a controller, seriously. I even implemented the Steam Input API so you can use whatever wacky controller you want</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All's Well That Whatever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/5787d46f4a114e4d652cab8e9bc99b50bd2a98fa.jpg"},{"name":"Master Mole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/84b3f1f036ccafc26c6e1e6bf71df7202f215a85.jpg"},{"name":"Grandmaster Mole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/1e56283de7b3593023c22bd2a80f8ffc166d12b8.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/9ca4b6cae04c76decb5855271f9e28b9944b5cea.jpg"},{"name":"Master Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/2dadcdbe8aebf0b245dfcfd0392fdbd2c1aa8642.jpg"},{"name":"Grandmaster Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/9eada64be21019a17f7024a8491f3b21bfea7be4.jpg"},{"name":"Played With Everyone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/20deb8d8323a5b8278b20258b15014ebd5acdf3d.jpg"},{"name":"Good With Everyone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/8da764589fff551fae39f7e300cc029822baf49f.jpg"},{"name":"Great With Everyone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/f06bff00206321797923866c5890be678c71b0be.jpg"},{"name":"The More The Merrier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2831730/f6ef975f609ed70c2bc4cc4020be0849110b4791.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2831730?t=1751084381","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2831730?t=1751084381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751084381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751084381","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Fantasy violence, revealing outfits and nudity, crude humor, strong language."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Millie's back and she's still mad! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this latest installment of the long-running Millie Megavolte series, you play as Millie Megavolte, Lance LeTourre, Kilzek Green, Anne Abelle and a ton of new characters too as they fight for what's right (&quot;right&quot; being a relative term here). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic! Instead of one big adventure, the story is told through lots of short ones. Every story involves different characters and gives a piece of the bigger picture of what's going on. At first, Millie and Lance set out to stop the Mole King but things get a little more complicated from there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey Mode</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Done with Story Mode? Great! Play Journey Mode FOREVER! Journey Mode is a rogue-lite-lite where the areas are randomized and the levels themselves are shuffled. Pick your team of four characters or go in solo and rampage across the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cool Bullet Points</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The humor is back! Those who don't like shock or blue humor may want to cover their eyes. There are girls in skimpy outfits running around too</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 14+ unique playable characters. Millie and her friends are back with a whole cast of even more friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play dress-up with multiple outfits and weapon choices for every character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Four difficulty levels from Noob to Master (plus two secret ones). Don't get pwned! Also, the baseline difficulty is way easier than the head-crushing-hard previous MTC games were </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No more tiny Flash-o-Vision! Millie 8 uses a custom engine (built with SFML) and runs in full 1080 and doesn't chug to reach 60 FPS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play with a controller, seriously. I even implemented the Steam Input API so you can use whatever wacky controller you want</p></li></ul>","developers":["Myroid-Type Comics"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831730/header.jpg?t=1751084381","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2831730/723176/47d26c96dbf5eb148202ba972776c299e8277c49/1750945696/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750488223","dash_h264":"htt